WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
A tropical rainforest.

2
00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:06.650
Tall trees, layer on
layer, thick with life.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.430
Now clear a plot and plant crops.

4
00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.630
Soon, the soil is thin and
pale, and the crops struggle.

5
00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:17.650
If the forest was so rich,
where were its riches kept?

6
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:21.150
In this mission, you'll model
an ecosystem as a system,

7
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:26.710
with inputs, stores, transfers and
outputs of energy and nutrients.

8
00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.070
Then you'll follow energy
through a food web,

9
00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:34.150
level by level, and track nutrients
as they cycle between the stores.

10
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:37.890
Your mission: find out where
a rainforest keeps its riches,

11
00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.990
and why clearing loses them so fast.
